   198	///   the source (Bayesian beta++), emits `intelligence_corrected`, and — if
   199	///   the field is health-affecting on an account — triggers a background
   200	///   health recalc so the UI reflects the correction immediately.
   201	/// - `dismissed` → records that the claim is wrong, penalizes the source,
   202	///   creates a suppression tombstone keyed by `field` + `item_key`, and emits
   203	///   `intelligence_dismissed`.
