.docs/decisions/0112-migration-strategy-parallel-run-and-cutover.md:41:Both the old and new paths execute; the user receives the old path's output. The validator logs divergences to the `maintenance_audit` table (tagged as parallel-run comparisons, not real maintenance invocations). The target: ≤1% divergence on a rolling 100-invocation window. Exact-match required for Read abilities; LLM-as-judge acceptable for Transform.
