.docs/plans/_archive/v1.0.0.md:231:**Goal:** Transcript extraction produces CS-grounded, categorized intelligence (not generic one-liners). All computed intelligence is surfaced on the appropriate page. Reports consume meeting content, not just metadata. The pipeline audit that produced these issues found: wins/risks have no definitions, ~15 intelligence fields are computed but never rendered, Weekly Impact and Monthly Wrapped have zero meeting content, and interaction dynamics are extracted then discarded.
