.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:93:7. Renders provenance via [ADR-0108](0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md)'s `render_provenance_for(prov, Agent, McpTool)`.
.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:178:6. **Provenance rendering integrated into bridges.** Every response carries appropriately-rendered provenance per [ADR-0108](0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md).
.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:191:4. **Action latency growth.** Generic dispatch + schema validation + provenance rendering adds ~1–5ms per invocation. Mitigation: negligible for synthesis-bound abilities; measurable only for trivial reads.
.docs/decisions/0111-surface-independent-ability-invocation.md:199:- [ADR-0108: Provenance Rendering and Privacy](0108-provenance-rendering-and-privacy.md) — Bridges call the renderer on return.
