.docs/decisions/0046-entity-mode-architecture.md:42:**"Both" mode is first-class from day one.** The dashboard renders a unified attention view sorted by urgency — entity type is a badge, not a section. The sidebar provides Accounts and Projects as separate navigation sections. Designing for "both" from the start avoids an architectural retrofit.
